abstract: >-
  Source code, pretrained model, compact plotting-data caches, and figure-reproduction
  scripts associated with the manuscript "Intensifying global near-inertial wind work".
  The framework combines a damped-slab
  dynamical model with a drifter-constrained physics-informed deep-learning correction
  for global near-inertial current and wind-work estimation.
keywords:
  - near-inertial wind work
  - near-inertial waves
  - physics-informed deep learning
  - AmpGainResNet
  - surface drifters
  - slab model
  - ERA5
  - ORAS5
  - ocean energetics
